Aren stands beside the old northern stones. "Alby is quiet from here. Don't mistake that for peace."
+ [What opens the boss gate?]
    "Three trials: a wandering spider, a trapped chest, and a stone switch. Clear all three to face the Giant Spider. The side encounter and supplies are optional."
    -> END
+ [And the treasure?]
    "Beyond the guardian lie five chests. Choose one, resolve its rewards, then Continue home. Only that return counts as a clear."
    -> END
+ [What if I cannot finish?]
    "Confirm Abandon in the journey menu to come home. Defeat brings you to Elara. Both preserve claimed rewards and experience, but neither counts as a clear."
    -> END
